{"job_id":"F-302300e5f92db8fc9046","family_id":"F-302300e5f92db8fc9046","title":"육군보병학교령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"ee33e576bd214ccb0138193da3da03f256c636527ef0405dbb118178f51f6d5f","source_hash":"8e701db38487b81a7e09db5c642d3a3249c336a143f86bf75645466f569e3093","text":"陆军步兵学校规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":103,"target_id":"e24591999477138c9a3316fe083eec7fe51b9a9af916033d85a64a5c9d340f70","source_hash":"fff819dd7ca8047195e0091c8d0009ce8ba2212054251e3216042fb57414ab6c","text":"第一条（设立和使命）陆军步兵学校（以下简称“步兵学校”）在陆军内设立，目的是对陆军步兵所需的战术和学术进行调查、研究和教育，并进一步发展这些战术和学术。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":103,"end":227,"target_id":"d1fb88a853cfc21b8664d1dbc14a245468e6aa5939288d18e307079293e159a5","source_hash":"d05c3e6c35cde31d3e5cb4b581d9e152d9279ec89925c19e90f9e14f28561929","text":"第 2 条（主要）\n①步兵学校应任命一名校长。\n②校长应从陆军将官或二级及以上文职军事人员中任命。<2025年9月2日修订>\n校长奉陆军参谋长的命令，负责学校事务，指挥和监督下属人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":227,"end":346,"target_id":"9250f47d8af5bcc9b266107e9cbb0748dd343b567b2673148baf9130d192728f","source_hash":"531faff70e67e02afa624384d202de9e849b8c28e81db7532885c7608be66dde","text":"第三条（单位和部门的设立）\n①在步兵学校建立必要的单位和部门。\n② 根据第1款规定设立部队的职责和组织事项，由国防部长决定；设立部门和分工事项，由陆军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":346,"end":408,"target_id":"b2a217fbaccf10c5c2c849b0301d9502e6bb583de937d747ca7c3b602cd5e4fd","source_hash":"bb81a10a291c27e990ceeb958237c174485b3714575779bb06a7f34a58a030de","text":"第四条（课程等）陆军参谋长应当确定步兵学校的课程、课时以及其他必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":408,"end":518,"target_id":"a8ffe9dbf64fcf4bd7db344174f18d6947b265a1c461380f060f9e6e8d13c54a","source_hash":"a31f649a9cdcc00b0906532d6746a0ad303ab86b259803e70632cea4562154c5","text":"第五条（海军或空军人员学习）陆军参谋长可以按照海军参谋长或空军参谋长的请求，经国防部长批准，安排海军或空军人员到步兵学校学习。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":518,"end":564,"target_id":"9f72f88e6d9e80ffe7dd5e8da5c0f90f9169094fe266b225cf83eb14608490c7","source_hash":"1a7f9346548ba781487a8407b19342bf19727ed45b45e5d5f09fac0878454350","text":"第六条（人员配额） 步兵学校应配备军事人员和文职人员，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":564,"end":615,"target_id":"cc3cf51c338b68891304ffceff12f9be588bd4c25c0a70cbc2f59468685a4e55","source_hash":"7316fbc422b2ac55ce82e5d2a41d1a1bbde767e0f337016b9506cd2f32303b23","text":"补充条款 <第12864号，1989年12月27日>\n\n本法令自1990年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":615,"end":652,"target_id":"68da970384d942294353c431785be8b4e40a1b0adda6507037bd7e668908d54f","source_hash":"bcbac3476423bc26bb6fdb790cfc6a302d20cf563c0225ba3d66252f1b0cf575","text":"补充规定（军事人员法实施令修正案）<1992年8月13日第13708号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":652,"end":681,"target_id":"ad60012eb814a0572328f7febb525f2d29cb2a696df88c475a21456d3a7cca1b","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":681,"end":731,"target_id":"8493f3e856838dd80869c47e0d8dbc0af1cb2dda47cd742c3569dcf202c7c9fc","source_hash":"6d41840d148a5ad628e712b997cd903560eb583461b854a4d28bb46e9d0ece7c","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑥ 已省略\n\n  ⑦ 陆军步兵学校条例修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":731,"end":782,"target_id":"6acc7ddfe4f2d5495df721064977a571daee18cf1ff1bbaab3075742a35c013c","source_hash":"9ac587420bc27ce6f3f676ee35611ed3b04cb994ee0f248fd32d3087c84b5771","text":"第二条第二款如下。\n\n②校长应被任命为陆军将官。\n\n⑧ 和 ⑨ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":782,"end":815,"target_id":"4e308c5ebd55a4504f2bc8d247e0ef0f5f4e0c397106791787c6ca5743aca2a5","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令》）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":815,"end":852,"target_id":"db4717ef518e6fd729be0512e1e6351b886aae5bf175b3d0c411a7fb2b4f5e39","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":852,"end":866,"target_id":"2f3debd2e775095e8f6710964ea34a784f41b089e003b8a6ee9b56e6acc51512","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":866,"end":985,"target_id":"a272bf0dff96ce90ad1c8fb9047bf3d8b2e7561e0fa632cb3adcd360baa0df18","source_hash":"b2d4922067409054d040b3c9f350bc61fb19fb81f8ef459e2b49e63c24aa31c9","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<60> 已省略\n\n  <61> 陆军步兵学校条例部分修订如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <62> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004422-273553-ko","scope":"BODY","start":985,"end":1069,"target_id":"936a5a98bf98ff2c7cfeeca5493a5831c325405585c0007c927008b65337e872","source_hash":"12fb47a24a8a8d48c76b328876ef72f13041b533e51fcc7761110c3332d77371","text":"增补（关于部分修改九项法令以提高军事组织运作效率的总统令）<第35726号，2025年9月2日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}